#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/experimental/gemm_sp_op/index.rst:56
msgid ""
"This is the explicit asynchronous Hopper WGMMA counterpart to the default "
"synchronous ``T.gemm_sp(...)`` interface, with two stricter guarantees: - it "
"always requests the WGMMA SP lowering path - it never auto-emits an inlined "
"``warpgroup_wait``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/experimental/gemm_sp_op/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"If the current target or operand pattern cannot use Hopper WGMMA SP, "
"compilation fails instead of silently falling back to MMA SP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/experimental/gemm_sp_op/index.rst:82
msgid ""
"This is the explicit asynchronous Blackwell TCGEN05 counterpart to the "
"default synchronous ``T.gemm_sp(...)`` interface, with two stricter "
"guarantees: - it always requests the TCGEN05 SP lowering path - it never "
"auto-emits an inlined ``mbarrier_wait_parity``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/experimental/gemm_sp_op/index.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the current target or operand pattern cannot use Blackwell TCGEN05 SP, "
"compilation fails instead of silently falling back to another sparse GEMM "
"path."
msgstr ""
